WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
Welcome to UCF Campus, the final stop before you take action.

2
00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:06.702
You've worked through every major area of U.S. market entry.

3
00:00:06.702 --> 00:00:11.488
Now it's time to decide what you're ready to do, and what needs attention first.

4
00:00:11.488 --> 00:00:15.318
In this module, you'll: Complete a structured self-assessment across all core topics.

5
00:00:15.318 --> 00:00:18.828
Identify your highest-priority gaps and where to get the right support.

6
00:00:18.828 --> 00:00:22.658
Download the resources that turn what you've learned into an action plan.

7
00:00:22.658 --> 00:00:23.934
This isn't a test.

8
00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:27.444
It's a decision tool to help you choose what comes next.

9
00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:29.040
Let's take the next step.
